---
// src/pages/404.astro
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>404 // SIGNAL_FAILURE</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            /* MAIN SITE MASTER PALETTE */
            --blue-light: #0033cc;
            --blue-dark:  #e0eaf5;

            /* LIGHT MODE PALETTE */
            --bg-light: #ffffff;
            --text-light: #111111;
            --grid-light: #e0e6ed;
            --card-bg-light: #ffffff;
            --hover-bg-light: #e0e6ed;

            /* DARK MODE PALETTE */
            --bg-dark: #0a1428;
            --text-dark: #e0eaf5;
            --grid-dark: #1c2e4a;
            --card-bg-dark: #112240;
            --hover-bg-dark: #1d3557;

            /* DYNAMIC LIGHT-DARK VARIABLES */
            --blueprint-blue: light-dark(var(--blue-light), var(--blue-dark));
            --bg-color: light-dark(var(--bg-light), var(--bg-dark));
            --text-color: light-dark(var(--text-light), var(--text-dark));
            --grid-color: light-dark(var(--grid-light), var(--grid-dark));
            --card-bg: light-dark(var(--card-bg-light), var(--card-bg-dark));
            --hover-bg: light-dark(var(--hover-bg-light), var(--hover-bg-dark));
        }

        /* Explicitly tell the browser that this website supports both modes */
        html {
            color-scheme: light dark;
        }

        body {
            /* Base colors and the architectural grid */
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            background-image:
                    linear-gradient(var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px),
                    linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
            color: var(--text-color);

            /* Layout mechanics for centering the console */
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 1rem;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* The Hardware Error Container */
        .error-console {
            /* Forces the terminal aesthetic just for this box */
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;

            border: 2px solid var(--blueprint-blue);
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--blueprint-blue);
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .system-header {
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--blueprint-blue);
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .error-code {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
            color: var(--blueprint-blue);
        }

        .error-message {
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* The Brutalist Return Button */
        .return-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--blueprint-blue);
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 2px solid var(--blueprint-blue);
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: all 0.2s ease-out;
        }

        .return-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--blueprint-blue);
            color: var(--bg-color);
            transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
            /* Uses your dynamic text color for the hover shadow to ensure perfect contrast */
            box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--text-color);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="error-console">
    <div class="system-header">
        STATUS: FATAL_ROUTING_ERROR // COORD: UNKNOWN
    </div>

    <h1 class="error-code">404</h1>

    <p class="error-message">
        > SIGNAL LOST.<br><br>
        > The line you requested was likely closed by the Branch Line Committee (despite objections heard by the Transport User's Consultative Committee), and subsequently razed, sold off, and built over.<br><br>
    </p>

    <a href="/" class="return-btn">Return</a>
</div>

</body>
</html>